OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,6,Fand a few scattered showers. The
OL,7,Fshowers turning more frequent for
OL,8,FCaithness and Sutherland later where
OL,9,Fit will be rather breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright evening with a few
OL,12,Fshowers, the showers predominately
OL,13,Faffecting parts of Caithness and
OL,14,FSutherland. Turning mainly dry through
OL,15,Fthe rest of the night with some clear
OL,16,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
