OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FEarly showers across northern
OL,6,Fareas will clear, leaving a bright day
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunny spells. Sunshine
OL,8,Fwill turn a little hazy at times
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,12,Frather changeable and breezy period
OL,13,Fwith variable cloud and a few showery
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain. Best conditions in
OL,15,Fthe east where it will be often warm
OL,16,For very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
